#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:91
msgid "Choosing a Model"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:93
msgid "When selecting a model for an AI Agent, consider:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:95
msgid ""
"**Context window** — Larger windows allow longer conversations and more "
"tool results. Models with 128K+ context windows are recommended for "
"complex infrastructure queries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:96
msgid ""
"**Tool calling support** — Ensure the model supports function/tool "
"calling (most modern models do). This is required for MCP tool "
"invocation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:97
msgid ""
"**Speed vs. quality** — Faster models (GPT-4o-mini, Claude 3 Haiku) are "
"better for frequent, simple queries. Higher-quality models (GPT-4o, "
"Claude 3 Opus) are better for complex reasoning and multi-step "
"operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ai/llm_integrations.rst:98
msgid ""
"**Cost** — High-throughput environments with many users should consider "
"cost per token carefully."
msgstr ""

